1
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,850
I light it every evening.

2
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:11,367
Tube by tube.

3
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:17,333
By midnight, the street is dark.

4
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:28,300
Then one piece goes out.

5
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,667
I left it.

6
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:44,300
The last light on Pell Street.
